      <h2>Hi, I’m Jay</h2>
      <p>I started Jay Home Buyers to give homeowners a simpler option when a regular sale doesn’t fit, like when a house needs more work than makes sense to do, a family is settling an estate, or life just needs to move faster than a listing allows.</p>
      <p>When you reach out, you deal with me, not a call centre or a national franchise passing your information around. I look at every property myself, explain how I got to the number, and give you the space to decide.</p>

      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>We buy houses for cash, as-is, in Ontario and Alberta. Sometimes we keep and fix a house. Often we partner with other investors and renovators who take on the project. Either way, your offer and your closing date are in writing, with lawyers on both sides.</p>
      <p>If buying your house ourselves isn’t a good fit, we’ll say so. With your permission, we can connect you with a licensed realtor we trust.</p>

      <h2>What we stand by</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Every offer is reviewed personally.</strong> No algorithm decides your number.</li>
        <li><strong>No pressure, ever.</strong> You get a number and the space to decide. Walking away costs you nothing.</li>
        <li><strong>Plain, honest answers.</strong> If listing with a realtor would get you more, we’ll tell you.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="note">Jay Home Buyers is a private buyer, not a real estate brokerage. We don’t list or market homes on behalf of sellers.</p>
